Here is the MiniZinc model for the given problem:

```minizinc
% Define the number of cities
int: num_cities = 12;

% Define the locations of the cities
array[1..num_cities, 1..2] of int: locations = [
    (288, 149), (288, 129), (270, 133), (256, 141), (256, 163), (246, 157),
    (236, 169), (228, 169), (228, 148), (220, 164), (212, 172), (204, 159)
];

% Define the distance matrix
array[1..num_cities, 1..num_cities] of int: distance;
constraint forall(i in 1..num_cities, j in 1..num_cities) (
    distance[i, j] = abs(locations[i, 1] - locations[j, 1]) + abs(locations[i, 2] - locations[j, 2])
);

% Define the decision variable for the tour
