Here is the MiniZinc model for the problem:

```minizinc
% Define the number of stages
int: stage = 8;

% Define the positions of the wolf, goat, cabbage, and boat
% 0 = starting shore, 1 = destination shore
array[1..stage] of var 0..1: wolf_pos;
array[1..stage] of var 0..1: goat_pos;
array[1..stage] of var 0..1: cabbage_pos;
array[1..stage] of var 0..1: boat_pos;

