                "\"" ++ "boat_pos" ++ "\": " ++ show(boat_pos[s])
            ]) ++ "}"
        | s in 1..stage]) ++ "]"
    ]),
    "}"
];
```

This model ensures that the wolf, goat, and cabbage are moved across the river without any of them being eaten, and that the boat carries only one item at a time. The output will show the positions of the wolf, goat, cabbage, and boat at each stage.

