   - `at_most`: An array where `at_most[p]` is the maximum number of cars with property `p` that can be present in any group of `per_slots[p]` consecutive slots.
   - `per_slots`: An array where `per_slots[p]` is the size of the group of consecutive slots for property `p`.
   - `requires`: A matrix where `requires[t, p]` is 1 if car type `t` requires property `p`, and 0 otherwise.

